<section class="about" aria-labelledby="about-title" id="about">
  <div class="container-page about__inner">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">A bit more context</p>
      <h2 id="about-title">The work is about people, not just technology.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about__copy">
      <p>
        I love the complexity of software. For me, it has never been just about technology. It is
        about building strong teams, keeping our commitments, and creating software that lasts.
      </p>
      <p>
        As AI changes our industry, trust, transparency, collaboration, and a deep understanding of
        the domain matter even more. Not just code.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside work, I build <a href="https://github.com/maik-hasler/afunto" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Afunto</a>,
        a regional platform for volunteering. Away from the keyboard, I play Magic, board games, and
        Path of Exile 2, and I'm slowly training for the Oldenburg Marathon.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

